- * References:
- * [1] Kalman, R.E. (1960). "A New Approach to Linear Filtering and 
- *     Prediction Problems"
- * [2] Simon, D. (2006). "Optimal State Estimation"
- */
-
-#ifndef CPPPLOT_CONTROL_KALMAN_HPP
-#define CPPPLOT_CONTROL_KALMAN_HPP
-
