-    /**
-     * @brief Real Schur decomposition: A = Q * T * Q^T
-     * 
-     * T is quasi-upper-triangular (upper triangular with 1x1 and 2x2 blocks
-     * on the diagonal). 1x1 blocks are real eigenvalues, 2x2 blocks contain
-     * complex conjugate pairs.
