-/**
- * @brief Subspace State-Space System Identification (Simplified N4SID)
- *
- * Estimates discrete-time State-Space matrices (A, B, C, D) purely from
- * input-output data. This is a foundational algorithm for Data-Driven Control,
- * leveraging SVD on block Hankel matrices to extract the observability
- * subspace and system order.
